    "Straight while you keep pace with your goal; it dips when you fall a glass behind. Water, tea and coffee all count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "مستقيم ما دامت الوتيرة متوافقة مع الهدف، وينخفض عند التأخر بكوب. الماء والشاي والقهوة كلها تُحتسب."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Straight while you take your breaks; it dips where you skip one.": {
      "localizations": {
